    "details": {
      "alignment": "Chaotic Neutral",
      "type": {
        "value": "undead",
        "subtype": "boo"
      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Era sheet: Highsun 1, 955 BF, Peach's Castle.</em> Art and stats describe this figure on the night of the Day Of (events.json <code>highsun_1_955_bf_the_day_of</code>), not the present day of the campaign (1040 BF).</p><p><strong>Scene kit — The Interloper at the Council.</strong> Bowser and his force burst in on a crucial palace meeting. This is a GM scene kit, not a filed event; nothing on this sheet changes the canon record of what happened that night.</p><p>A round white ghost with a wide grin and a long tongue, already inside the walls before the doors come down. Boos are how an interloper knows exactly which room the meeting is in.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
